sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant W as React
    participant A as FastAPI
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant B as Worker
    participant F as FeaturePipeline
    participant M as ModelRegistry
    participant S as ArtifactStore

    U->>W: Configure and start experiment
    W->>A: POST experiment
    A->>D: immutable config + job
    A-->>W: 202 Accepted
    B->>D: claim job
    B->>F: create leakage-safe matrices
    loop algorithms and folds
        B->>M: fit and predict
        B->>D: fold/horizon metrics
    end
    B->>M: final fit and one-time final test
    B->>S: model bundle and manifests
    B->>D: recommendation and completed state
    W->>A: poll details
    A-->>W: metrics and artifacts
